From 4ecaf52e29460848d24b8300ec769e8b184dba47
Subject: ext/websocket: let embedders vet resolved connect addresses
Origin: https://github.com/robtfm/deno/commit/4ecaf52e29460848d24b8300ec769e8b184dba47
Date: 2026-08-11T16:56:31+01:00

Add WebSocketPermissions::check_resolved (default allow-all). handshake_websocket resolves the host once and dials exactly the vetted addresses, keeping the hostname for TLS SNI, so an embedder enforcing an SSRF policy gets checked==dialled.
